    "displayName": "Red Wind Challenging Cargo Recovery",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "RED WIND LINEHAUL\n'YOUR GOODS IN GOOD HANDS'\n----------------------------\n\nWe’re having trouble completing a hauling mission and need a reliable contractor who has experience working in dangerous environments to complete the job. Just as a heads up, the cargo is in an abandoned ship surrounded by multiple, highly dangerous outlaws. We strongly advise you bring some backup with you and heavy-duty tractor beam to retrieve the client’s goods. Details follow:\n\nRECOVERY LOCATION\n     · [Location]\n\nDROP OFF LOCATION\n     · Freight elevator at [Destination]\n\nSince this is a bit risky, we’re offering proportionate pay. I’ll leave it up to you to decide how to distribute it to your crew.\n\nTAKE PRIDE IN YOUR WORK – Even as a contractor you are representing Red Wind Linehaul. Do not intentionally do anything to harm the company’s reputation.",
